  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Centered Assistance to PALM Workers &#x2013; Regional Pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM&apos;s regional project, &quot;Family-centered Assistance to PALM Workers - Regional Pilot,&quot; will support partner governments in the Pacific and strengthen the assistance provided to PALM workers and their families. This project will be delivered synergistically with IOM&apos;s existing initiatives under its Pacific Strategy 2022-2026 and IOM Strategic Plan 2024-2028. It will contribute to the overall objective of supporting labour migrants and their families throughout the circular labour mobility journey.</narrative>
  </description>
